                                                                                                    
  Usage: bab completion [OPTIONS] [[bash|zsh|fish]]                                                 
                                                                                                    
  Print the completion script for SHELL (default: $SHELL), or --install it.                         
                                                                                                    
  Options                                                                                           
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  
       --prog      TEXT   program name to complete [default=bab]                                    
       --install          install it and source it from your shell startup file                     
  -h   --help             Show this message and exit.                                               
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
